  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>츄<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> 팡짇<ruby>붸<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>쥬<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IDkL9qGX4bk?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>手<rt>츄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>捧<rt>팡-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>짇붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>酒<rt>쥬ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiù phang-jit-puē-jiù\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goâ-sīm-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>蹛<rt>돠</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    toa’tio jit-e-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>蹛<rt>돠</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    toa’tio jit-e-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>酒<rt>쥬ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>吞<rt>툰ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>落<rt>롷-</rt></ruby><ruby>腹內<rt>박ˆ래ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>時陣<rt>시준ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jiù thūn-loh-pâk-lāi’e si-jūn\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>就<rt>됴-</rt></ruby><ruby>知影<rt>재ˉ얄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>苦澀<rt>커ˆ샵</rt></ruby> <ruby>𨘗<rt>뒤ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>底<rt>도ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>來<rt>래ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    lì tio-jāi-yà̰ goà’e khôr-siap tùi-tô-lái\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>只不過<rt>지ˆ붇ˆ고</rt></ruby> <ruby>酒仙<rt>쥬ˆ셴ˆ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>模樣<rt>뻐율ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jî-pût-ko jiû-siên’e bor-yṵ̄\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>在<rt>재-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>夢中<rt>빵뎡ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>看<rt>콸</rt></ruby>’키래 <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>啥<rt>살ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>仝款<rt>강콴ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jai-lî-goà’e bang-tiông khoa̰’khi-lai bo-sà̰ kang-khoàn\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>手<rt>츄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>捧<rt>팡-</rt></ruby><ruby>一杯<rt>짇붸ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>酒<rt>쥬ˋ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chiù phang-jit-puē-jiù\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>꽈<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>心內<rt>심ˉ래ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    goâ-sīm-lāi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>蹛<rt>돠</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    toa’tio jit-e-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>蹛<rt>돠</rt></ruby>’됴 <ruby>一个<rt>짇에-</rt></ruby><ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    toa’tio jit-e-láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>手<rt>츄ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>點<rt>댬ˆ-</rt></ruby>